msgid "proxy mode: dialing the target address from each stream's header"
msgstr "代理模式：按每个流头部中的目标地址拨号"

msgid ""
"Generic proxy mode: dial the address from each stream's header instead of a "
"fixed --forward target. Pairs with `connect --socks5-listen`."
msgstr ""
"通用代理模式：按每个流头部中的目标地址拨号，而非固定的 --forward 目标。"
"与 `connect --socks5-listen` 配合使用。"

msgid ""
"Speak SOCKS5 (no-auth, CONNECT only) on this local address; local clients "
"can then reach any destination through the remote `serve --proxy`."
msgstr ""
"在此本地地址上提供 SOCKS5 服务（无认证，仅 CONNECT）；本地客户端可通过"
"远端的 `serve --proxy` 访问任意目的地。"

msgid "serve requires either --forward or --proxy"
msgstr "serve 需要 --forward 或 --proxy 其中之一"


# --- TUN 模式 ---

msgid "Make two machines reachable at the IP layer over QUIC datagrams."
msgstr "通过 QUIC datagram 让两台机器在 IP 层互相可达。"

msgid ""
"Make two machines reachable at the IP layer over QUIC datagrams.\n"
"\n"
"Creates a TUN interface (needs root / CAP_NET_ADMIN) and routes the peer's "
"virtual IP through it. Unlike `serve`/`connect`, which forward one TCP "
"port, this bridges the whole machine: TCP, UDP and ICMP all work on the "
"peer's virtual IP, with no per-port setup. Point-to-point only in v1 — see "
"docs/tun-design.md."
msgstr ""
"通过 QUIC datagram 让两台机器在 IP 层互相可达。\n"
"\n"
"创建一个 TUN 接口（需要 root / CAP_NET_ADMIN），并把对端的虚拟 IP 路由到它。"
"与只转发单个 TCP 端口的 `serve`/`connect` 不同，本模式桥接整台机器：TCP、"
"UDP、ICMP 都能通过对端虚拟 IP 访问，无需逐个端口配置。v1 仅支持点对点——"
"见 docs/tun-design.md。"

msgid "Exposed side: accept a peer and bridge this machine to it at the IP layer."
msgstr "被访问侧：接受对端连接，并在 IP 层桥接本机与对端。"

msgid ""
"Exposed side: accept a peer and bridge this machine to it at the IP layer. "
"Prints this node's virtual IP and EndpointId, then forwards all packets to "
"the first peer that dials."
msgstr ""
"被访问侧：接受对端连接，并在 IP 层桥接本机与对端。打印本节点的虚拟 IP 与 "
"EndpointId，然后向第一个拨号的对端转发所有数据包。"

msgid "Dial a peer and bridge this machine to it at the IP layer."
msgstr "拨号连接对端，并在 IP 层桥接本机与对端。"

msgid ""
"Override this node's virtual IP (default: derived from its EndpointId, "
"inside 172.24.0.0/16)."
msgstr ""
"覆盖本节点的虚拟 IP（默认：由其 EndpointId 派生，位于 172.24.0.0/16 段内）。"

msgid ""
"Upper bound for the TUN interface MTU (default 1280). The final MTU is "
"min(this, the negotiated QUIC datagram max); values above 1280 are refused."
msgstr ""
"TUN 接口 MTU 的上限（默认 1280）。最终 MTU 为 min(该值, 协商出的 QUIC "
"datagram 上限)；超过 1280 的值会被拒绝。"


msgid ""
"--mtu must be at most 1280 (got {0}); higher values would fragment the outer "
"QUIC datagrams"
msgstr ""
"--mtu 最大只能为 1280（收到 {0}）；更大的值会导致外层 QUIC datagram 分片"

msgid ""
"the peer or path does not support QUIC datagrams; TUN mode cannot work over "
"this connection.\n"
"Refusing to start rather than silently falling back to a stream transport."
msgstr ""
"对端或路径不支持 QUIC datagram；此连接上无法使用 TUN 模式。\n"
"拒绝启动，而不是静默回退到 stream 传输。"

msgid "running `ip {0}`"
msgstr "正在执行 `ip {0}`"

msgid "command `ip {0}` failed: {1}"
msgstr "命令 `ip {0}` 执行失败：{1}"

msgid "checking local interfaces for the virtual IP"
msgstr "检查本地接口是否占用该虚拟 IP"

msgid ""
"virtual IP {0} is already assigned to a local interface.\n"
"Pick a different one with --tun-ip."
msgstr ""
"虚拟 IP {0} 已被本地某个接口占用。\n"
"请用 --tun-ip 指定其他地址。"

msgid "TUN mode currently supports Linux only"
msgstr "TUN 模式目前仅支持 Linux"

msgid "creating TUN device (needs root / CAP_NET_ADMIN)"
msgstr "创建 TUN 设备（需要 root / CAP_NET_ADMIN）"

msgid "reading TUN interface name"
msgstr "读取 TUN 接口名称"

msgid "reading packet from TUN device"
msgstr "从 TUN 设备读取数据包"


msgid "writing packet to TUN device"
msgstr "向 TUN 设备写入数据包"

msgid "peer disconnected"
msgstr "对端已断开"

msgid "your virtual IP (the peer reaches you here):"
msgstr "你的虚拟 IP（对端通过它访问本机）："

msgid "your EndpointId (give this to peers running `tun connect --to`):"
msgstr "你的 EndpointId（把它给运行 `tun connect --to` 的对端）："

msgid "TUN session established"
msgstr "TUN 会话已建立"

msgid "rejecting malformed incoming connection"
msgstr "拒绝格式异常的入站连接"

msgid "completing connection handshake"
msgstr "完成连接握手"

msgid "endpoint closed"
msgstr "端点已关闭"

msgid "TUN session error"
msgstr "TUN 会话错误"

msgid "connected. your virtual IP: {0}"
msgstr "已连接。你的虚拟 IP：{0}"

msgid "peer {0} is reachable at {1}"
msgstr "对端 {0} 在 {1} 可达"

msgid "TUN datagram negotiation: max_datagram_size={0}, interface MTU={1}"
msgstr "TUN datagram 协商：max_datagram_size={0}，接口 MTU={1}"

msgid "TUN interface MTU raised {0} → {1} (datagram path MTU converged)"
msgstr "TUN 接口 MTU 已提升 {0} → {1}（datagram 路径 MTU 探测收敛）"

msgid "peer did not complete the TUN address exchange"
msgstr "对端未完成 TUN 地址交换"

msgid "peer announced an unusable virtual IP {0}"
msgstr "对端宣告了不可用的虚拟 IP {0}"

msgid "creating identity directory {0}"
msgstr "创建身份目录 {0}"

msgid "migrating legacy identity from {0} to {1}"
msgstr "正在将旧身份从 {0} 迁移到 {1}"

msgid "migrated legacy identity from {0} to {1}"
msgstr "已将旧身份从 {0} 迁移到 {1}"

msgid "identity migration failed; using the legacy file"
msgstr "身份迁移失败；继续使用旧文件"

msgid "could not remove the legacy identity file {0} (you can delete it manually)"
msgstr "无法删除旧身份文件 {0}（可手动删除）"

msgid "could not remove peer route"
msgstr "无法移除对端路由"

msgid "datagram error; assuming transient path switch (iroh may be migrating the connection)"
msgstr "datagram 错误；假定为瞬时路径切换（iroh 可能正在迁移连接）"

msgid "connection lost; waiting for reconnect"
msgstr "连接已断开；等待重连"

msgid "reconnected to peer"
msgstr "已重新连接到对端"

msgid "reconnect failed; retrying in {0}"
msgstr "重连失败；将在 {0} 后重试"

msgid "Log output format: text (human-readable) or json (structured, for jq/CI pipelines)."
msgstr "日志输出格式：text（人类可读）或 json（结构化，供 jq/CI 流水线使用）。"

msgid "ephemeral identity: this EndpointId will not persist across restarts"
msgstr "临时身份：此 EndpointId 不会在重启后保持不变"

msgid "Use a temporary identity that is never written to disk: the EndpointId changes every start. Conflicts with --identity."
msgstr "使用从不写入磁盘的临时身份：每次启动 EndpointId 都会变化。与 --identity 互斥。"

msgid "Measure RTT to a remote node over the P2P network."
msgstr "测量到 P2P 网络中远端节点的 RTT。"

msgid "pinging {0}..."
msgstr "正在 ping {0}……"

msgid "pong from {0}: RTT {1}µs"
msgstr "来自 {0} 的 pong：RTT {1}µs"

msgid "path: direct (UDP)"
msgstr "路径：直连（UDP）"

msgid "path: relay (no direct UDP path yet)"
msgstr "路径：relay（尚无直连 UDP 路径）"

msgid "peer echoed a mismatched ping timestamp"
msgstr "对端回显的 ping 时间戳不匹配"

# --- TUN 模式改进 / SOCKS5 严格化 ---

msgid "choose_mtu({0}, {1}) = {2}"
msgstr "选择MTU({0}, {1}) = {2}"

msgid "reconnecting in {0}"
msgstr "{0}后重新连接"

msgid "ping probe error"
msgstr "ping 探测出错"

msgid "no acceptable SOCKS5 authentication method"
msgstr "没有可接受的 SOCKS5 认证方式"

msgid "note: --max-conns is not used by TUN mode (single point-to-point session)"
msgstr "提示：--max-conns 对 TUN 模式无效（点对点单会话）"

msgid "Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)"
msgstr "打印此消息或给定子命令的帮助"

msgid "Print help for the subcommand(s)"
msgstr "打印指定子命令的帮助"

msgid "printing help"
msgstr "打印帮助"

msgid "Print help"
msgstr "打印帮助"

msgid "Print help. `-h` lists commands and examples; `--help` shows full option details."
msgstr "打印帮助。`-h` 只列命令与示例；`--help` 显示完整选项说明。"

msgid "Print version"
msgstr "打印版本"

msgid "path datagram ceiling dropped to {0}; lowered TUN interface MTU and dropped one packet"
msgstr "路径数据报上限降至 {0}，已下调 TUN 接口 MTU 并丢弃一个数据包"

msgid "dropped {0} oversized packets in the last 2s (interface MTU is {1}; injected {2} ICMP Fragmentation Needed)"
msgstr "最近 2 秒内丢弃了 {0} 个超限数据包（接口 MTU 为 {1}；已注入 {2} 个 ICMP Fragmentation Needed）"

msgid "failed to inject ICMP Fragmentation Needed into TUN"
msgstr "向 TUN 注入 ICMP Fragmentation Needed 失败"

msgid "QUIC keepalive interval in seconds (default 5). Keeps NAT UDP mappings alive; the typical home-router mapping expires after 20-30s of idle. Raise it on high-latency links, lower it where NAT timeouts are aggressive."
msgstr "QUIC 保活间隔（秒，默认 5）。用于维持 NAT 的 UDP 映射；家庭路由器的映射通常在空闲 20-30 秒后过期。高延迟链路上可调大，NAT 超时激进的网络可调小。"

msgid "QUIC max idle timeout in seconds (default 30). After this long without traffic the peer is declared dead and the connection re-dialed. Raise it for lossy / high-latency links so a brief outage doesn't tear the connection down."
msgstr "QUIC 最大空闲超时（秒，默认 30）。超过此时间没有流量即判定对端已断开并重新拨号。在丢包/高延迟链路上调大，避免短暂中断就拆掉连接。"

msgid "Only accept P2P connections from these EndpointIds (repeatable). Default: accept anyone who knows this node's EndpointId. Strongly recommended when the node is reachable from untrusted networks."
msgstr "只接受来自这些 EndpointId 的 P2P 连接（可重复指定）。默认接受任何知道本节点 EndpointId 的对端。当节点暴露在不可信网络时强烈建议设置。"

msgid "In proxy mode, allow forwarding to private/loopback/link-local addresses (blocked by default to prevent SSRF — a malicious peer could otherwise make this node reach into your LAN or cloud metadata endpoints such as 169.254.169.254)."
msgstr "在代理模式下，允许转发到私网/回环/链路本地地址（默认阻止，以防 SSRF——恶意对端可能借此让本节点访问你的内网或云元数据端点，如 169.254.169.254）。"

msgid "Direct address hint(s) for the peer (repeatable), e.g. its public ip:port or a LAN address. Dialed directly, skipping discovery — use it when you exchanged addresses out-of-band and want no DNS/pkarr lookup (also faster reconnects). May be combined with --relay, which then stays as the fallback path."
msgstr "对端的直连地址提示（可重复指定），例如其公网 ip:port 或局域网地址。直接拨号、跳过发现——适用于双方线下交换地址、不想走 DNS/pkarr 查询的场景（重连也更快）。可与 --relay 组合，此时 relay 作为后备路径。"

msgid "Direct address hint(s) for the peer (repeatable) — see `connect --to-addr`. Dialed directly, skipping discovery."
msgstr "对端的直连地址提示（可重复指定）——参见 `connect --to-addr`。直接拨号、跳过发现。"

msgid "'{0}' is not a valid EndpointId in --allow"
msgstr "'{0}' 不是合法的 EndpointId（--allow）"

msgid "only accepting connections from {0} allowed peer(s)"
msgstr "只接受来自 {0} 个已授权对端的连接"

msgid "proxy targets in private/loopback ranges are blocked (use --allow-private to permit)"
msgstr "代理目标在私网/回环范围内被阻止（可用 --allow-private 放行）"

msgid "rejecting connection: peer is not in the --allow list"
msgstr "拒绝连接：对端不在 --allow 列表中"

msgid "target {0} is in a private/loopback/link-local range; blocked in proxy mode (use --allow-private to permit)"
msgstr "目标 {0} 属于私网/回环/链路本地范围；代理模式下已阻止（可用 --allow-private 放行）"

msgid "connection slot closed"
msgstr "连接槽已关闭"

msgid "dialing the peer's direct address hint(s): {0}"
msgstr "正在拨号对端的直连地址提示：{0}"

msgid "Passphrase protecting the identity key file. When set, the key is stored encrypted (Argon2id + XChaCha20-Poly1305) instead of plaintext hex, so a disk/backup leak doesn't expose the key. Prefer the LINK_P2P_PASSPHRASE environment variable over passing it inline — the flag value is visible in `ps` and shell history. Conflicts with --ephemeral."
msgstr "保护身份密钥文件的口令。设置后，密钥将以加密形式存储（Argon2id + XChaCha20-Poly1305）而非明文 hex，磁盘/备份泄露也无法拿到密钥。建议使用环境变量 LINK_P2P_PASSPHRASE 而非内联传参——flag 值会出现在 `ps` 和 shell 历史中。与 --ephemeral 互斥。"

msgid "using a passphrase-protected identity key file"
msgstr "正在使用口令保护的身份密钥文件"

msgid "encoding the passphrase salt"
msgstr "编码口令盐值"

msgid "invalid Argon2 parameters"
msgstr "非法的 Argon2 参数"

msgid "deriving key from passphrase"
msgstr "从口令派生密钥"

msgid "encrypting identity file failed"
msgstr "加密身份文件失败"

msgid "identity file is not passphrase-encrypted"
msgstr "身份文件不是口令加密格式"

msgid "incorrect passphrase or corrupted identity file"
msgstr "口令不正确或身份文件已损坏"

msgid "decrypted identity file is not valid UTF-8"
msgstr "解密后的身份文件不是有效的 UTF-8"

msgid "identity file is passphrase-encrypted but no passphrase was provided (use --identity-passphrase or LINK_P2P_PASSPHRASE)"
msgstr "身份文件已用口令加密，但未提供口令（请用 --identity-passphrase 或设置 LINK_P2P_PASSPHRASE）"

msgid "decrypting identity file"
msgstr "解密身份文件"

msgid "identity file is neither plaintext hex nor encrypted"
msgstr "身份文件既不是明文 hex 也不是加密格式"

msgid "re-encrypting the legacy plaintext identity file with the provided passphrase"
msgstr "正在用提供的口令重新加密旧版明文身份文件"

msgid "could not encrypt the legacy identity file; it stays plaintext on disk"
msgstr "无法加密旧版身份文件；它仍以明文留在磁盘上"

msgid "writing passphrase-encrypted identity to {0}"
msgstr "正在向 {0} 写入口令加密的身份密钥"

msgid "connect requires exactly one of --listen, --socks5-listen, or --stdio"
msgstr "connect 需要恰好指定 --listen、--socks5-listen 或 --stdio 之一"

msgid "connect requires exactly one of --listen or --socks5-listen"
msgstr "connect 需要恰好指定 --listen 或 --socks5-listen 之一"

msgid "--to - (read EndpointId from stdin) is only available on Unix builds"
msgstr "--to -（从 stdin 读取 EndpointId）仅在 Unix 构建中可用"

msgid "missing peer EndpointId (--to or LINK_P2P_TO)"
msgstr "缺少对端 EndpointId（--to 或 LINK_P2P_TO）"

msgid "--to - cannot be combined with --stdio (stdin conflict)"
msgstr "--to - 不能与 --stdio 同时使用（stdin 冲突）"

msgid "reading EndpointId from stdin"
msgstr "从 stdin 读取 EndpointId"

msgid "empty EndpointId on stdin"
msgstr "stdin 上的 EndpointId 为空"

msgid "--stream-recv-window / LINK_P2P_STREAM_RECV_WINDOW out of range"
msgstr "--stream-recv-window / LINK_P2P_STREAM_RECV_WINDOW 超出范围"

msgid "connected. piping stdin/stdout to the remote peer."
msgstr "已连接。正在将 stdin/stdout 对接到远程对端。"

msgid "opening stream"
msgstr "打开流"

msgid "domain length out of range in target header"
msgstr "目标头中的域名长度超出范围"

msgid "domain length out of range in SOCKS5 request"
msgstr "SOCKS5 请求中的域名长度超出范围"

msgid "rendering man page"
msgstr "生成 man 页"

msgid "writing man page"
msgstr "写入 man 页"

msgid "Quiet user-facing banners (errors still print). Independent of RUST_LOG / -v."
msgstr "减少面向用户的横幅输出（错误仍会打印）。与 RUST_LOG / -v 相互独立。"

msgid "Increase tracing detail (-v, -vv). Ignored when RUST_LOG is set."
msgstr "提高 tracing 详细度（-v、-vv）。若已设置 RUST_LOG 则忽略。"

msgid "QUIC congestion controller: cubic (default) or bbr3. Also LINK_P2P_CC. See docs/performance.md."
msgstr "QUIC 拥塞控制：cubic（默认）或 bbr3。也可设 LINK_P2P_CC。详见 docs/performance.md。"

msgid "QUIC connection send window in bytes. Also LINK_P2P_SEND_WINDOW."
msgstr "QUIC 连接发送窗口（字节）。也可设 LINK_P2P_SEND_WINDOW。"

msgid "QUIC per-stream receive window in bytes. Also LINK_P2P_STREAM_RECV_WINDOW."
msgstr "QUIC 每流接收窗口（字节）。也可设 LINK_P2P_STREAM_RECV_WINDOW。"

msgid "The remote node's EndpointId (printed by `serve` on startup). Use `-` to read one line from stdin. Also `LINK_P2P_TO`."
msgstr "对端节点的 EndpointId（`serve` 启动时打印）。Unix 上可用 `-` 从 stdin 读一行。也可设 `LINK_P2P_TO`。"

msgid "The remote node's EndpointId (printed by `serve` on startup). Also `LINK_P2P_TO`."
msgstr "对端节点的 EndpointId（`serve` 启动时打印）。也可设 `LINK_P2P_TO`。"

msgid "Pipe stdin/stdout to one QUIC stream (ssh ProxyCommand / rsync -e). Status banners go to stderr."
msgstr "将 stdin/stdout 接到一条 QUIC 流（ssh ProxyCommand / rsync -e）。状态横幅走 stderr。"

msgid "Output format: text (default) or json (for jq)."
msgstr "输出格式：text（默认）或 json（供 jq 使用）。"

msgid "Print a man page (troff) for link-p2p to stdout."
msgstr "将 link-p2p 的 man 页（troff）打印到 stdout。"

msgid "gathering entropy for identity salt"
msgstr "收集身份盐值的熵失败"

msgid "gathering entropy for identity nonce"
msgstr "收集身份 nonce 的熵失败"

msgid "identity file is truncated"
msgstr "身份文件被截断"

